{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、個別握手会in京都 でした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またしても、メチャカリかぶり しました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN40CQ9DN4S7A4HN0A9ADG4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n双子コーディネート です。\n春っぽくなりました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハム色のワンピースです。\n(実は、おだななに借りました)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、たくさんのお洋服に挑戦しました。\n赤黒なんて初めて着ました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、給食のおばさん･･･。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たいですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜お花シリーズ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN40EMWAV66A0XBJZAXSAS4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nオムくん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケチャップまできれいに再現されてる･･･|Δ`*\nここまできれいに作れるなんて感動!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉ちゃんにも見てもらいたい!\nすごく喜びそう〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺーちゃんとおそろいのお花が届きました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN40G19ANYCNYB12GRAEG82","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺーちゃんと時間合わなくて一緒に撮れなかったのでぺーの にゃーポーズで･･･。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺー 今度一緒にコスプレしよう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風船がついたお花!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN40HAJVHJ801QKV97YV9S7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nお部屋に飾りたい(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))\nバラがたくさん!!\n人生でバラを貰える機会はあまりないので嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"丸いお花がかわいい!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN40JPZ8QGST4DNZ7M8VR4V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nこの白くて丸いお花は、何ていうお花なんだろう･･･。\nサイリウムカラーだ!!\n服もお花もサイリウムカラー❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんの好きなガーベラがたくさん!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN40MBDECQGXQX2M5MCNK81","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n色がめちゃくちゃかわいい!\n理想のお花畑って感じです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、明日はお母さんの誕生日なのです･･･♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このお花の写真を送ろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また明日も、お花シリーズのせますね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN40PMBGVWXCEZHWVV9J085","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}